, Gerrit, deployment, and infrastructure configuration under `.github/` and `infra/`. contains confirmed comment or docstring bloat from the audit pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`. The file-specific constraints must survive consolidation.\n\n## Approach\nDelegate remediation to bounded directory/subsystem leaf cohorts. Each leaf edits only its declared paths, preserves the requirements recorded in its Scope, and supplies the authoritative file-impact set. This keeps responsibilities non-overlapping and each change reviewable in one session.\n\n## Scope\n- Direct container edits: none; repository edits belong to the leaf cohorts.\n- Delegated repository area: CI, Gerrit, deployment, and infrastructure configuration under `.github/` and `infra/`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every migrated path in this workstream appears in exactly one leaf Scope and matching file-impact record; verified by the migration inventory.\n- [ ] Each path's comments or docstrings retain its listed current constraints and consumer contract while removing redundant text; verified by the leaf's row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] Each leaf's declared verification commands exit 0 before that leaf closes.\n\n## Child decomposition\nEach directory/subsystem cohort owns all three criteria for its exact path set. Cohort path sets are disjoint; their union is this workstream's scope.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"none","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","3e32-a859-2153-4a1b"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"This workstream container makes no repository edits directly. Its leaf group tickets hold the exact paths; their commits and completion comments are the implementation evidence.","parent_id":"3e32-a859-2153-4a1b","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintai